  "id": "bacon-wrapped-water-chestnuts",
  "name": "Bacon-Wrapped Water Chestnuts",
  "subtitle": "Crisp bacon bites with a sweet-spicy glaze",
  "description": "Water chestnuts are wrapped in bacon, baked, and finished with a brown sugar, mayonnaise, and chili sauce topping.",
